Error [E3403]: `time.today` is non-deterministic and cannot appear in a pure evaluation.
  --> tests/ui/determinism/nondeterministic_time_classification_is_shared_by_purity_and_folding_2.jet:5:30
    |
  5 |     today :: comptime { date.today() }
    |                              ^^^^^
 Why: Pure evaluation must produce the same result on every machine.
 Fix: Remove this call, or keep it at runtime outside the `comptime` value.
 Denial: pure
 Call chain: time.today
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3403
